{'symbol': 'CFG', 'date': '2022-04-04 18:45:00', 'title': 'ARCUS BIOSCIENCES SET TO JOIN S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': 'NEW YORK , APRIL 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ARCUS BIOSCIENCES INC. (NYSE:RCUS) WILL REPLACE INVESTORS BANCORP INC. (NASD:ISBC) IN THE S&P SMALLCAP 600 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON THURSDAY, APRIL 7. S&P 500 CONSTITUENT CITIZENS FINANCIAL GROUP INC. (NYSE: CFG) IS ACQUIRING INVESTORS BANCORP IN A DEAL EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED SOON PENDING FINAL CLOSING CONDITIONS.'}